Reading Hangul documents (server/src/files/hwp.ts), writing new .hwpx files
(server/src/files/hwpx-*.ts) and changing existing .hwpx and .hwp files
(server/src/files/hwpx-edit.ts, hwp-edit.ts, hwp-changes.ts, cfb.ts) is this
repository's own code (AGPL-3.0-only), written from Hancom's public HWP 5.0
and OWPML (KS X 6101) documents and from the layout of files saved by Hangul;
no third-party code, template or document is included. python-hwpx
(Apache-2.0) and pypandoc-hwpx (MIT) were read as prior art for the file
layout only.
