Promo video templates and the intro deck use unchanged Pretendard 1.3.9 (OFL-1.1): the
variable woff2 and the static Regular, Bold and ExtraBold TTFs, see resources/notices/pretendard/. The MP4 render runs the HyperFrames CLI 0.9.15
(Apache-2.0), installed outside this repository's dependencies on a development
machine only (scripts/promo-video/).
The promo video's music and sound effects are CC0 1.0 or public domain; their
sources and licences are listed in resources/promo-video/audio/SOURCES.md.

The intro deck draws a subset of the Lucide icons (from lucide-react, the icon
set the web app uses), converted to path data in server/src/intro-deck/icons.ts
by scripts/gen-deck-icons.ts. Lucide is ISC, Copyright (c) 2026 Lucide Icons and
Contributors; the icons Lucide lists as derived from Feather are MIT, Copyright
(c) 2013-present Cole Bemis. See resources/notices/lucide/; release bundles
carry it in licenses/lucide/.

HWP previews use rhwp 0.8.7 (MIT) and unchanged Noto Sans KR Regular (OFL-1.1).
Exact pins, upstream notices and source-offer details: resources/hwp/.
Release distributions preserve these in licenses/hwp/.

